<title>USA: Orange &amp; Rockland president/COO resigns.</title>
<headline>Orange &amp; Rockland president/COO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>PEARL RIVER, N.Y. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orange and Rockland Utilities Inc said Friday its president and chief operating officer, Larry Brodsky, left the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Brodsky has been with the company as president and COO since January 1996.</p>
<p>The company said in a news release it is still considering whether to fill the vacancy.</p>
</text>
